WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.832
Tom and his sisters lay in the pigpen.

2
00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:06.542
They were covered in mud.

3
00:00:06.543 --> 00:00:09.360
"Ugh!" Mittens groaned.

4
00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:12.058
"How will we get clean?"

5
00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:13.762
Tom sat up.

6
00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:15.660
"Let's go to the pond.

7
00:00:15.661 --> 00:00:20.347
We can get clean there."

8
00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:25.341
Tom helped Mittens get up.

9
00:00:25.342 --> 00:00:37.418
Mittens helped Moppet get up.

10
00:00:37.419 --> 00:00:44.288
The three kittens walked down the lane.

11
00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:47.835
Soon the kittens were near the pond.

12
00:00:47.836 --> 00:00:49.959
Tom heard something.

13
00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.915
"This is fun!" someone said.

14
00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:56.997
"That's Jemima Puddle-Duck!" Tom thought.

15
00:00:56.998 --> 00:01:00.684
"Throw the ball to me!" Jemima said.

16
00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:04.602
"Ball?" Tom thought.

17
00:01:04.603 --> 00:01:07.127
He ran to the pond.

18
00:01:07.128 --> 00:01:11.951
He saw three ducks.

19
00:01:11.952 --> 00:01:17.870
One duck threw Tom's ball to Jemima.

20
00:01:17.871 --> 00:01:20.685
"Hey!" Tom cried.

21
00:01:20.686 --> 00:01:23.392
"Huh?" Jemima looked at him.

22
00:01:23.393 --> 00:01:24.139
Bonk!

23
00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:26.477
The ball bounced off her head.

24
00:01:26.478 --> 00:01:29.537
"Ouch!" Jemima cried.

25
00:01:29.538 --> 00:01:33.747
"I got that ball for my birthday," Tom said.

26
00:01:33.748 --> 00:01:35.948
"Then I lost it."

27
00:01:35.949 --> 00:01:50.695
Jemima laughed. "Well, I found it for you!"

28
00:01:50.696 --> 00:01:57.500
Everyone played catch together.

29
00:01:57.501 --> 00:02:01.260
Soon it was time for Tom's birthday party.

30
00:02:01.261 --> 00:02:08.355
Of course, the ducks went too!

